      source: "Engraved frontispiece to The Interesting Narrative of the Life of Olaudah Equiano, engraved by Daniel Orme after a painting by William Denton and lettered 'Published March 1. 1789 by G. Vassa'; British Library, shelfmark 1489.g.50. The scan (1071 x 1785) was trimmed of its page margins and binding shadow and downscaled to 707 x 1200 with no upscaling.",
