      attribution: "Tsuda Umeko, photograph reproduced in Yoshikawa Toshikazu, Tsuda Umeko (Fujo Shimbunsha, 1930); image from the National Diet Library, Japan, Portraits of Modern Japanese Historical Figures",
      attributionUrl: "https://www.ndl.go.jp/portrait/e/datas/292.html",
